{
  "summary": "This experiment tested an RNA-only model using scvi_n200 encoder with multiprofile data and avgpool aggregation, comparing against the singleprofile baseline. Validation accuracy of 0.650 (F1: 0.628) suggests improved performance over previous RNA-only models, indicating potential benefits from multiprofile data or aggregation method. Uncertainty remains about the relative contribution of profile setting vs. aggregation, and how this compares to multimodal configurations or alternative encodings."
}

